// LCD/LED pins: working lcd1024_v2 project; camera/DDR: chapter 45.
// Ethernet TX/MDIO: chapter 59; RX pins: chapter 56/58. Target GW5AT-60B.
// S0 resets the whole design; S4 toggles the Gaussian filter.
// LCD, 50 MHz clock and S4 constraints copied directly from EXAMPLE_LCD/src/tft_ctrl.cst.
// The eight diagnostic LED and Ethernet constraints are appended below.
